# #5833. Evicting the leaf's foreign-high entry without raising the eviction floor forgets
# another activation's append. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestEvictionDropsForeignHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an evicted foreign-high entry leaves no floor
BOUNDS: WithRestart = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0

--- FIND
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no eviction floor.
    Max({startHead - 1} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}})
--- END
